    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, the target is temporarily <em>Tormented</em>. While <em>Tormented</em>, whenever the target is spotlighted, they must also <strong>mark a Stress</strong>, their will eroded by endless wailing.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against all targets within Very Close range. On a success, they must <strong>mark a Stress</strong> and are temporarily <em>Restrained</em>.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
